Documentation. Much of docs/ (the guide, the language reference, the
target language notes, the release notes, docs/internals/kotlin/, and
docs/contributing/signing-commits.md) is adapted from the Temper
Language Documentation: the temperlang.dev site's sources and generated
pages, release notes, and READMEs in the temperlang/temper repository
